        "date": "2018-11-13",
        "license": "CC BY-SA4.0; viewed only",
        "observations": "Actually inspected complementary close view: low ashlar courses and many scattered pale marble/stone fragments, broken moulded cornice slabs, a short round fragment and irregular chunky blocks amid vegetation. No exact carving or stone inventory is copied."
      }
